  "statement": "Sustainability is essential for the ATM system to minimize its environmental impact. Requirement GRN-01 focuses on reducing energy consumption during transaction processing, while GRN-02 ensures transparency by providing a carbon footprint report for each transaction. GRN-03 emphasizes the use of energy-efficient hardware, and GRN-04 aims to minimize data storage requirements, which can reduce energy use. GRN-05 promotes electronic transaction records to cut down on paper waste. GRN-06 ensures the ATM shuts down during inactivity to save energy, and GRN-07 assesses environmental impact annually, reinforcing accountability. These requirements collectively enhance the sustainability of the ATM system.",
